@baseUrl = http://localhost:5032
@jwtToken = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_JWT
@clientId = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CONSUMER_KEY
@clientSecret = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CONSUMER_SECRET

### Prepare CRM queue and preview records (changes local centreids/queue; no Salesforce calls)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sequenceDate": "2026-10-29",
  "formTypes": ["DR"],
  "status": "Matched"
}

### Empty preview form types: 400 (no database changes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "formTypes": []
}

### Upsert a final patient selected by centreid and CRM queue membership
# Replace with a centreid returned by CRM preview.
# This request writes to CRM.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreid": "MR2610-00001",
  "targetSystem": "CRM"
}

### Empty centreid: 400 (no CRM writes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreid": " ",
  "targetSystem": "CRM"
}

### Unsupported target system: 400 (no CRM writes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreid": "MR2610-00001",
  "targetSystem": "LIS"
}

### Missing centreid or CRM queue membership: 404 (no CRM writes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/syncPatientdetailsFinal
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreid": "NONEXISTENT_TEST_CENTREID",
  "targetSystem": "CRM"
}

### GET token using server-configured credentials (no body or query credentials)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

### GET token without JWT: 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/token

### Get a Salesforce token using form credentials (requires Crm:BaseUrl)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id={{clientId}}&client_secret={{clientSecret}}

### Get a Salesforce token using server-configured credentials
# Reads BaseUrl, grant_type, client_id, and client_secret from the Crm JSON section.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded


### Unsupported grant type: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/token
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password

### Missing JWT: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Crm/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials
